data: {"id": "5bcb8d8eb5ca4fd5-thinking-layer-210", "run_id": "5bcb8d8eb5ca4fd5", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Pod `workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6` 的状态确认为 `Running` 但 `READY` 为 `0/1`。\n\n根据 Runbook 定义，`Running` 但 `READY 0/1` 的情况属于 `pod-notready-probe-failed` 类型（由探针配置错误、健康接口失败、启动慢等原因导致）。\n\n我将获取 `pod-notready-probe-failed` 相关的诊断手册，以便进一步验证。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788459042996}

